{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 100,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the past years, Spain has received\nmillions and millions of immigrants."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4433,
    "dDurationMs": 5467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is more than Italy, France, Belgium\nand the Netherlands combined."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10000,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But while other countries like\nDenmark, Germany and the UK have tried"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13700,
    "dDurationMs": 3533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to curb immigration\nin response to public concerns,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17533,
    "dDurationMs": 3667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Spain's prime\nMinister has said that welcoming"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21200,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the outsiders is not only a duty,\nbut a step towards"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25200,
    "dDurationMs": 5133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "guaranteeing the welfare state,\nand at first sight it may have been right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30666,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You see, over the past five years,\nSpanish GDP growth has been faster"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36066,
    "dDurationMs": 5034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than ex-communist countries\nlike even Poland or Romania."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41300,
    "dDurationMs": 3633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that despite Spain's ultra low\nfertility rates,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44933,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which have been one of Europe's lowest\nfor decades."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48300,
    "dDurationMs": 3866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, if it wasn't for immigration,\nwhich are the pink bars here,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52166,
    "dDurationMs": 5667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the Spanish population would have started\ndeclining for now almost a decade."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57933,
    "dDurationMs": 5500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And ECB researchers have estimated that\nwhen it comes to Spain's economic growth,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63800,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "78% of of GDP per\ndecade from this from this year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67833,
    "dDurationMs": 3933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So is Spain's prime minister\nright about immigration? Can rapidly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71766,
    "dDurationMs": 3334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "aging countries\nafford to have a generous welfare state"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75100,
    "dDurationMs": 4033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "without mass immigration?\nOr is Spain's economic growth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79433,
    "dDurationMs": 3067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "much less impressive\nthan it seems initially?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82733,
    "dDurationMs": 3767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or are there other major costs\nthat Spain's government is conveniently"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86500,
    "dDurationMs": 1233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sweeping under the rug?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87733,
    "dDurationMs": 3367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like culture clashes,\ncrime waves or housing shortages,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 91300,
    "dDurationMs": 3833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which would change Spain's perfect\nmigration story?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95400,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To properly answer these questions,\nI enlisted the help of Spanish economist"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99300,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Doctor Alejandro Iribas de la Puerta\nto help me dive deep into Spain's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 104200,
    "dDurationMs": 4433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "immigration data to first understand\nwhat Spain's immigration surge"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108800,
    "dDurationMs": 3833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "actually looks like, because for decades,\nSpain was known as the country"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112633,
    "dDurationMs": 4967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that people left, not the one\nthat they moved to. After World War Two"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117633,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "some Spaniards fled the fascist\nFranco regime for political reasons,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121933,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but most were actually just"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123833,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "chasing better work opportunities\nin France, Germany or Switzerland."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127533,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as a consequence, immigrants inside\nSpain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130833,
    "dDurationMs": 4967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were barely 1% of the Spanish population\nin the early 1990s."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136033,
    "dDurationMs": 3267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then have a look at this chart\nin a single decade,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139300,
    "dDurationMs": 4433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the immigrant share of the population\njumped to almost over"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143733,
    "dDurationMs": 3067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "11% in 2007."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146800,
    "dDurationMs": 3866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is the fastest\nincrease ever recorded in an OECD country."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150733,
    "dDurationMs": 2933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The reason was that\na gigantic economic boom"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153666,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that generated huge demand for low\nskilled labor"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156800,
    "dDurationMs": 3433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in construction services\nand agriculture was happening."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160633,
    "dDurationMs": 3533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, immigrants in this decade\nmostly came from Morocco,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 164166,
    "dDurationMs": 4134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ecuador, Romania and China,\nand many arrived without papers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168300,
    "dDurationMs": 3766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the government\njust kept legalizing them in waves,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172266,
    "dDurationMs": 3267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just to keep pace with the growing stock\nof illegal immigrants."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 175600,
    "dDurationMs": 4333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then, famously, Spain's property\nbubble burst in 2008."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 180233,
    "dDurationMs": 4067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The crisis hit construction\nand other immigrant heavy sectors hardest,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184300,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and therefore unemployment climbed over\n20% and stayed there for years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188833,
    "dDurationMs": 3033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Immigration inflows,\nof course, declined rapidly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192133,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Many immigrants even left, so Spain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195033,
    "dDurationMs": 4933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "barely got hit by the 2015 2016\nrefugee crisis"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199966,
    "dDurationMs": 3667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that famously overwhelmed\nSweden and Germany."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204166,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, as soon as the Spanish economy\nrecovered again,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207466,
    "dDurationMs": 4767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "immigration made a massive comeback\nafter a little Covid dipped."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212300,
    "dDurationMs": 3566,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so now the inflow of refugees\nis even bigger"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 215866,
    "dDurationMs": 3467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than it was during\nthe height of the first boom in 2007."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219366,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what changed?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220466,
    "dDurationMs": 4167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How did Spain become Europe's\nhottest immigration destination today?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224733,
    "dDurationMs": 2633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, it can be explained by three forces."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 227366,
    "dDurationMs": 4234,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first force is that Spain's economy\nfinally recovered from the property"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 231600,
    "dDurationMs": 800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "crisis."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232400,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So today, Spain's unemployment\nrate is only about 10%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 236700,
    "dDurationMs": 2633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, that's\nstill very high by most country standards."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239333,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But for Spain, it's close to almost\nhow low it was ever"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 244466,
    "dDurationMs": 3734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "during Spain's boom in 2006 2007."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248366,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second force is immigration\nfriendly government policies"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251766,
    "dDurationMs": 4034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that actually were not implemented\nby Spain's left wing government,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255933,
    "dDurationMs": 4433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but were negotiated within the EU\nby the previous conservative government."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260400,
    "dDurationMs": 4166,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And of these, the most important\nwere actually the Schengen visa exemptions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264800,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "granted to Colombia and to Peru in 2016."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 269766,
    "dDurationMs": 4134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And according to Spanish economist Casas\nFernandes Huertas Moraga,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 274233,
    "dDurationMs": 3867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "letting immigrants from these countries\nenter the EU without a visa."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 278300,
    "dDurationMs": 5833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Increased immigration to Spanish\nspeaking Spain by 2 to 3 times."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284200,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Finally, force number three."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 285800,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are push factors\ngrowing instability in Central America"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 290500,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and especially Venezuela, has increased"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294100,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the number of arrivals\nfrom these countries, and many of them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 297900,
    "dDurationMs": 5333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have used the refugee asylum channel\nto obtain legal status in Spain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303300,
    "dDurationMs": 2933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So now we know\nwhat's driving this immigration boom."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 306233,
    "dDurationMs": 1567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But is it a success?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307800,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, for that, two factors are crucial"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311100,
    "dDurationMs": 2733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "skill and skill to see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313833,
    "dDurationMs": 4733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Much like Europe's\ncontroversial 2015 2016 immigration wave."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318700,
    "dDurationMs": 1133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But unlike"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319833,
    "dDurationMs": 3867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ireland, for example, which attracts\na lot of highly educated foreigners,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324166,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Spain's migration wave attracts\na lot of low skilled foreigners."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329166,
    "dDurationMs": 2434,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is important\nbecause we know from European research"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331600,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that low skilled immigrants\ntend to be involved in crime more and tend"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 335100,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to contribute less due to the welfare\nstate than highly skilled ones."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339400,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, given that the immigrant population\nin Spain is younger and less educated than"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343000,
    "dDurationMs": 4066,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the average Spaniard, it's of course not\nsurprising that they are overrepresented"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 347066,
    "dDurationMs": 3967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in Spanish prisons\ncompared to how many are in the country."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351166,
    "dDurationMs": 2867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But counterintuitively,\nthat doesn't mean that these immigrants"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 354033,
    "dDurationMs": 3067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are causing crime to go up in Spain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 357166,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is, if we purely look at the number\nof assaults, theft and robberies,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362400,
    "dDurationMs": 4966,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then these are trending down\nwith the exception of assaults."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 367666,
    "dDurationMs": 4267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it doesn't take into account that\nthe population of Spain is increasing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 372000,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you do that, then the crime rate\nis actually very similar"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 375300,
    "dDurationMs": 3933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to 2010,\ndespite the millions of new immigrants."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379366,
    "dDurationMs": 1267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If we take an even longer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 380633,
    "dDurationMs": 3567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "term perspective, then we can see that\nthe homicide rate in the 1990s"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384366,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "used to be much higher\nthan current levels, and has gone down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 387866,
    "dDurationMs": 4267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "during the same period\nthat immigration exploded in Spain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392300,
    "dDurationMs": 2866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this may explain\nwhy very few Spaniards today"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 395166,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rank crime among their top three concerns."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 399666,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Immigration, on the other hand,\nis mentioned by roughly 19%"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404466,
    "dDurationMs": 4734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the population, which is substantial,\nbut nothing like the U.S."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409200,
    "dDurationMs": 433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or U.K."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409633,
    "dDurationMs": 4667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or Italy, where immigration has become\na defining electoral issue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414333,
    "dDurationMs": 4033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So Spain is receiving many,\nmany more immigrants than other countries."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418366,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And yet immigration is far\nless of a concern for people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 422066,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in Spain than in other countries. Why?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 425066,
    "dDurationMs": 4934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, one feasible explanation is that,\nunlike in Europe's 2016 wave,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 430200,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "most immigrants to Spain already share\neither a language"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 433533,
    "dDurationMs": 3133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or much of the culture with Spaniards."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437000,
    "dDurationMs": 4166,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as you can see here, only around\n20% of immigrants in Spain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441166,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "come from Africa and the Middle East\nin green and in purple."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 446066,
    "dDurationMs": 5067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's actually down\nfrom about 30% in 2013."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451666,
    "dDurationMs": 6200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead, almost 60% of immigrants\nare from Latin America."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 457900,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the orange color."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459800,
    "dDurationMs": 4666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the rest is from Eastern Europe\nand from rich countries."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 464933,
    "dDurationMs": 5267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This softens the ethnic tensions\nthat you see elsewhere in Europe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 470400,
    "dDurationMs": 4233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it could also explain why\nimmigration is not as much of a concern"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474633,
    "dDurationMs": 3967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as you might expect,\ngiven this mass migration experiment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 478800,
    "dDurationMs": 5500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, despite its impressive\nGDP growth numbers on paper, Spain's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 484300,
    "dDurationMs": 5833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "economy seems to be a bigger concern\nslightly for Spaniards than immigration."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 490333,
    "dDurationMs": 4467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So is immigration\nactually making Spain richer?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 494833,
    "dDurationMs": 2633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because while Spain's total GDP\ngrowth numbers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497466,
    "dDurationMs": 3634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "look impressive, we should not forget that\nif you bring in more people,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 501100,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the economy as a whole, of course, grows."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 504200,
    "dDurationMs": 2766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What really matters is GDP per person."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 506966,
    "dDurationMs": 4134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as you can see here,\nif you look at GDP"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 511100,
    "dDurationMs": 4133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "per person,\nthen Spain's growth is still impressive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 515566,
    "dDurationMs": 2734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it's no longer number one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 518300,
    "dDurationMs": 3666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But still, even per person,\ngrowth is not so bad,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 522066,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is slightly counterintuitive given\nthat it's mostly low skilled immigrants"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 526166,
    "dDurationMs": 934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that are coming to Spain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 527100,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So how could they be good for Spain's\neconomy?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 530366,
    "dDurationMs": 5567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, first, there is the welfare state\nthat Spain's Prime Minister has mentioned."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 536066,
    "dDurationMs": 3334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After all, since Spain is a\nrelatively old country, an influx of young"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 539400,
    "dDurationMs": 4033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "working immigrants should theoretically\nimprove the sustainability"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 543433,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of Spain's pension system,\nat least in the short run."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 546833,
    "dDurationMs": 4633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You see, if we look at the welfare state\nover the course of the life of an average"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 551466,
    "dDurationMs": 3067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "person, then if they are not working,\nif they're young,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 554533,
    "dDurationMs": 4967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they are draining the welfare state\nbecause they go to school, for example."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 559866,
    "dDurationMs": 4534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then when they start working, then\nthey are contributing to the welfare state"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 564600,
    "dDurationMs": 3166,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because they pay their taxes,\nwhich funds education"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 567766,
    "dDurationMs": 3134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the young people, and they pay,\nof course, their pension contributions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 570900,
    "dDurationMs": 5900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then when they retire, boom,\nthey again become a net drain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 576833,
    "dDurationMs": 3667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the welfare state\nin a well-functioning welfare system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 580800,
    "dDurationMs": 3266,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then the contributions are, on average,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 584266,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bigger than what people take\nfrom the welfare system."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 587900,
    "dDurationMs": 1933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And crucially,\nthese low skilled immigrants"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 589833,
    "dDurationMs": 5333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "coming to Spain are typically already\nof working age, so they do not take"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 595166,
    "dDurationMs": 3534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from the welfare state when they're young\nand they are now contributing to it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 598733,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, not surprisingly, currently\nin Spain, immigrants contribute around"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 602266,
    "dDurationMs": 5834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "10% of Social Security revenue, while\naccounting only for 1% of its spending."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 608266,
    "dDurationMs": 2967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the Spanish government\nloves to point to this as proof of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 611233,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how much immigrants give back to society."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 614366,
    "dDurationMs": 5734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But is this actually sustainable because\nimmigrants, like the rest of us, also age?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 620200,
    "dDurationMs": 2966,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the real question is\nwhether their lifetime contributions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 623166,
    "dDurationMs": 4767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will exceed the benefits\nthey will be entitled to after retirement."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 628100,
    "dDurationMs": 3933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And here's a problem\nif someone is a high skilled native"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 632166,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with a very well-paying job,\nthen their curve looks like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 636500,
    "dDurationMs": 3766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They contribute more into the system\nover their lifetime than they take out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 640866,
    "dDurationMs": 2734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what happens if a very low skilled"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 643600,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "immigrant comes in\nthat will only have a very low wage?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 648200,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then, while they may contribute\na little bit into the system,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 652500,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they could still take out more from it\nin the end."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 656166,
    "dDurationMs": 3467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of course, then the question will be\nhow big will the cost"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 660000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "be for the Spanish government\nin the future?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 663333,
    "dDurationMs": 2867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This turns out to be a very hard\nquestion to answer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 666200,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because you have to take into account\nmany things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 669500,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How much public services do they consume?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 672400,
    "dDurationMs": 3266,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How much do they pay in taxes\nand how much will they help?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 675666,
    "dDurationMs": 4467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Spaniards work longer hours, for example,\nby providing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 680133,
    "dDurationMs": 3833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "childcare services\nto highly skilled mothers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 684533,
    "dDurationMs": 3667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And of course, what happens\nto the kids of immigrants?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 688766,
    "dDurationMs": 4267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Other countries with better\ndata have tried to put some numbers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 693233,
    "dDurationMs": 1367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into this question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 694600,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, in Denmark,\nresearchers have found that Danish workers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 699100,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and those from rich countries"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 702366,
    "dDurationMs": 3067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tend to have a curve\nthat looks very healthy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 705600,
    "dDurationMs": 4833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but that lowly skilled\nmigrants from other countries"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 710633,
    "dDurationMs": 3533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "do not, in the end,\nmake the welfare system sustainable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 714400,
    "dDurationMs": 3633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Spain is not like Denmark\nin very crucial ways."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 718033,
    "dDurationMs": 4633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We cannot copy paste\nthat result into Spain because Denmark has"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 722933,
    "dDurationMs": 2767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "very generous public housing\nthat Spain doesn't have,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 725700,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Denmark has far larger\nsocial transfers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 729600,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to low income families,\nwhich Spain also does not have."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 734300,
    "dDurationMs": 4066,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So while immigrants in Spain\ndo not contribute a lot into the system,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 738533,
    "dDurationMs": 4567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they also cost less\nthan another northern European countries."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 743266,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the net fiscal cost\ncould end up being relatively small."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 748766,
    "dDurationMs": 3267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But even if immigrants do not end up\ncosting Spain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 752266,
    "dDurationMs": 3267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "much more in pensions\nover their lifetime, then"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 755533,
    "dDurationMs": 3633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's still the problem that they do\nnot have that many children themselves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 759233,
    "dDurationMs": 567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that means that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 759800,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "while the system may look much better\ntoday, it could be that in 30 years"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 763700,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "time, Spain again has the same problem\nwhere they do not have many children"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 768300,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they have a lot of old people now,\nincluding former immigrants."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 772700,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That being said, just if we're looking at\ntoday Spain's immigration"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 777000,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "boom, even though they're young, skilled,\nbecause they're young,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 780300,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they are making the pension system\nmore sustainable right now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 784800,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what about working age Spaniards?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 786900,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Are immigrants\nmaking them better off as well?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 790000,
    "dDurationMs": 2633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or are they just taking local jobs?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 792633,
    "dDurationMs": 4567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, given that the unemployment rate\nis lower than it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 797566,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "almost ever was, it's\nquite difficult to argue that immigrants"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 800766,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are purely taking jobs away from Spaniards\nand not creating new ones."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 805566,
    "dDurationMs": 4534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What could be happening, though, is that\ninstead they are pushing down wages,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 810400,
    "dDurationMs": 4666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "especially in sectors like agriculture,\nhospitality and construction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 815166,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this could help explain\nwhy inflation adjusted wages"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 818466,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have been pretty stagnant\nover the last two decades."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 823133,
    "dDurationMs": 3533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then again, as we've seen earlier,\nmigration"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 826966,
    "dDurationMs": 4267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "only picked up after 2016\nand Spanish wages"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 831233,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have not clearly gone down after that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 834333,
    "dDurationMs": 533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On top of that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 834866,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we simply do not know what life would have\nlooked like without these immigrants"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 838200,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if it wasn't for immigrants."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 839400,
    "dDurationMs": 4933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Would childcare, elderly care, and food\nhave been much more expensive in Spain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 844333,
    "dDurationMs": 2767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because there are not enough people\nto do those jobs?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 847100,
    "dDurationMs": 1466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When considering all of this evidence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 848566,
    "dDurationMs": 4134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I do not think that immigrants are clearly\nmaking Spain's economy much better,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 853166,
    "dDurationMs": 3634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but also know that they're clearly\nmaking Spain's economy much worse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 857166,
    "dDurationMs": 3067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I do think that it is very clear\nthat young immigrants are,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 860333,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at least for now, greatly\nhelping the Spanish retirement system,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 864200,
    "dDurationMs": 1266,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the welfare state."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 865466,
    "dDurationMs": 3634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I also think that it's clear\nthat unlike other immigration waves,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 869300,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this one\nhad less of a significant cultural impact"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 872566,
    "dDurationMs": 5034,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because so many immigrants are from South\nAmerica, former Spanish colonies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 877733,
    "dDurationMs": 4833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So Spain's prime minister is right about\nthe positive effects on the welfare state."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 882633,
    "dDurationMs": 3667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But are there no downside to\nthis immigration wave at all?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 886500,
    "dDurationMs": 1933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This brings us back to this chart."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 888433,
    "dDurationMs": 2933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do Spaniards worry about today?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 891366,
    "dDurationMs": 834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Immigration?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 892200,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sure, a little bit,\nbut the main worry is by far housing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 896100,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's not a coincidence,\nbecause more people simply means that you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 900500,
    "dDurationMs": 4366,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "need more facilities, more hospitals,\nmore infrastructure, more houses."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 905166,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if immigrants arrive."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 906266,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the government does not expand\npublic services in parallel,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 909666,
    "dDurationMs": 3634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "those services get congested\nlonger, waits for a doctor's appointment,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 913533,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more crowded public\ntransport and higher housing costs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 917766,
    "dDurationMs": 3634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So is the Spanish government\nkeeping up with their investments?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 921633,
    "dDurationMs": 1767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The answer is probably no."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 923400,
    "dDurationMs": 3033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, the Spanish socialist government\nhas increased"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 926766,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "investments in health care and education."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 929766,
    "dDurationMs": 1934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But housing?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 931700,
    "dDurationMs": 2033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It has barely moved."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 933733,
    "dDurationMs": 3167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What has increased,\nthough, are pension payments."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 937133,
    "dDurationMs": 3667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, interestingly,\nyou could argue that through its policies"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 940800,
    "dDurationMs": 966,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of keeping investments"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 941766,
    "dDurationMs": 3867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pretty low while letting in many,\nmany more people into the country, Spain's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 945633,
    "dDurationMs": 5033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "socialist government is actually doing\nsome sort of austerity in the shadows."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 951266,
    "dDurationMs": 2434,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A similar dynamic\nmight then be contributing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 953700,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the housing affordability crisis."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 956000,
    "dDurationMs": 3466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But okay, maybe immigrants have gone\ninto the construction sector,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 959466,
    "dDurationMs": 3767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the private sector has instead\ninvested a lot in new homes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 963533,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, as you can see here, new home\nbuilding in Spain is at an all time low"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 967866,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "despite a massive immigration boom."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 971000,
    "dDurationMs": 2333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So then this slide does not surprise,\nthough."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 973333,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "House prices have gone up like crazy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 976633,
    "dDurationMs": 3167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "while wages have remained\nstagnant in Spain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 979833,
    "dDurationMs": 3867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in conclusion, how is Spain's\nmass migration experiment going"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 983700,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and what can the world learn from it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 985200,
    "dDurationMs": 2766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For me, there are four key takeaways."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 987966,
    "dDurationMs": 6167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, Spain has shown us\nthat immigration can absolutely offer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 994133,
    "dDurationMs": 4267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at least some relief to a rapidly\naging population in the short run."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 998433,
    "dDurationMs": 4167,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Second, if you mainly bring in low skilled\nimmigrants that also have low fertility,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1002600,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then immigration is not a long term\nsustainable solution to rapid aging."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1007400,
    "dDurationMs": 1466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Third, if you encourage immigration"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1008866,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from culturally similar places,\nyou risk a far lower backlash."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1012200,
    "dDurationMs": 3966,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then, if these immigrants come from\nculturally very different places."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1016333,
    "dDurationMs": 4133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And fourth, if you do decide to encourage\nan immigration boom but fail to invest"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1020466,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in housing and infrastructure, you risk\na massive political backlash anyway."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1024866,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As people start suffering from rapidly\nincreasing house prices"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1028266,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the deterioration of public services."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1031333,
    "dDurationMs": 2967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So Spain's current\nimmigration boom is far less controversial"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1034300,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than the 2016 European migration crisis."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1037633,
    "dDurationMs": 3767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you do encourage immigration\nto save the pension system,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1041600,
    "dDurationMs": 2966,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "don't forget to build houses\nand infrastructure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1044566,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is my take."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1046066,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do you think?\nLet me know in the comments below."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1048966,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you want to know more about\nwhere Europe is heading on migration,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1052766,
    "dDurationMs": 3534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I highly recommend\nthat you check out some key "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1056300,
    "dDurationMs": 3033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "articles from our advertising sponsor,\nThe Economist."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1059533,
    "dDurationMs": 2533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, for a complimentary view\non the Spanish case."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1062066,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First, check out this piece on\nwhat Spain can teach the rest of Europe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1066200,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then, for a striking contrast, I recommend\nthis article on how the UK is heading"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1070933,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "towards a net zero migration policy\nand how that is playing out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1075766,
    "dDurationMs": 3934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And finally, if you want to dig\ninto the fiscal side of all of this, this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1079700,
    "dDurationMs": 3766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "article breaks down the fiscal effects\nof immigration on Denmark"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1083466,
    "dDurationMs": 3567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and why they matter for the debate\non supporting refugees."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1087600,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As these analysis show,\nThe Economist delivers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1090100,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "insights that truly help\nyou see the bigger picture."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1093333,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is why I highly recommend\nyou subscribe to The Economist,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1097166,
    "dDurationMs": 4834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which now offers an exclusive 35% discount\nfor money and macro viewers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1102400,
    "dDurationMs": 3833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whether you prefer their daily journalism\nin The Economist app, or you are like me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1106400,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and enjoy\ncatching up on the global economy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1108400,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over the weekend with a nice cup of coffee\nand the print edition"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1112133,
    "dDurationMs": 4033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You'll always stay on top of the latest global\ndevelopments and support journalism"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1116166,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that values factual information, integrity\nand an independent point of view."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1120900,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So don't miss out."
    } ]
